| Risk | 12/25 | Live sessions near a real repository and paid model turns, held by the scratch rule. |
| Research | 12/20 | Codex and Pi question tools are UNKNOWN, and restart session ids are unobserved. |
| **Total** | **37/70** | **Level 2** |
