.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README.md:288:| `header-add` | The document carries no template-source header, its anchors match the level's render exactly, none beyond the render and none missing, and that template renders a `SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE` marker. Stamps `<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: <marker> -->` after the frontmatter. | No level is recorded in `spec.md`, the template cannot be resolved or renders no template, the template renders no marker, the anchors carry extra or missing ids, or there is no frontmatter to stamp after. |
