specs/sk-doc/065-conversation-playbook-scenarios/001-scenario-contract/plan.md:110:| `turns[].questions[].optional` | boolean | No | When true, the turn still passes if the subject never asks. Defaults to false |
specs/sk-doc/065-conversation-playbook-scenarios/001-scenario-contract/plan.md:113:A question the subject asks that matches no entry fails the turn, and so does a required entry the subject never asks. A failed turn with `retry: 1` runs once more; after that a failure ends the runtime's run and later turns are recorded `NOT_RUN`. A skipped turn (exit 77) does not end the run. The check runs with `CONVERSATION_REPO_ROOT`, `CONVERSATION_RUN_DIR` and `CONVERSATION_TURN_DIR` set, so it can copy state files into the turn's evidence folder.
