specs/sk-doc/065-conversation-playbook-scenarios/001-scenario-contract/implementation-summary.md:49:A playbook scenario can now script the human side of a conversation as one `json conversation` block. The fleet validator parses it against a closed key set, reports each malformed shape as `CONVERSATION_SCRIPT_INVALID` with the field path, never runs `setup` or `check`, and exports the parser so the runner reads the same parse.
